Error [E0711]: The `Authority` handle `grant` can't escape its `#FX` block
  --> tests/ui/effects/grant_bound_process_spec_escape_is_e0711.jet:8:38
    |
  8 |         kept = process.cmd(["true"]).under(grant)
    |                                      ^^^^^
 Why: `#FX(…)` revokes the `Authority` at the end of its block (RAII); returning, storing, or sharing `grant` would let revoked rights outlive the scope
 Fix: Use `grant` only inside the `#FX` block, or perform the work there
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0711
